@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: MVP core / cross-cutting. Core presentation/application/files or shared authority/recovery invariant remains applicable.
allowmixing
title Proposed — Logical hierarchy versus canonical storage identity
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

rectangle "Optional display root" as R
rectangle "Optional logical folder A" as A
rectangle "Optional logical folder B" as B
rectangle "Display item / label" as L
rectangle "Stable artifact identity\ninternal canonical storage key" as I
rectangle "Independent protected consumer references" as P
R --> A
R --> B
A --> L
L --> I : identity reference, not user-controlled filesystem path
P --> I
note bottom of L
 Rename: label only if feature selected.
 Move: grouping association if selected; no authority inheritance assumed.
 Copy: new logical identity/reference with explicit quota/protection semantics.
 No native Git ref/object operations through raw folder mutation.
end note

@enduml
